#: scripts/tutorialUtils.lua:18
msgid ""
"Welcome to the EmptyEpsilon tutorial.\n"
"Note that this tutorial is designed to give you a quick overview of the "
"basic options for the game, but does not cover every single aspect.\n"
"\n"
"Press next to continue..."
msgstr ""
"[Beginne Preflight-Check]\n"
"Der Preflight-Check dient dazu, die wichtigsten Schiffssysteme vor dem "
"Abflug zu testen.\n"
"Lies jeweils den Text in eckigen Klammern - wie hier in der ersten Zeile - "
"laut vor.\n"
"Der restliche Text erklärt dir, was du tun musst.\n"
"\n"
"Drücke \"weiter\" um fortzusetzen..."
